# Hashes of words that must never appear in this repository's tracked files; scripts/private_words.py check reads them.
# Made with:  printf 'word\n' | python scripts/private_words.py hash   (a word of one to three words; normalised: NFKD, no accents, lower case)
# A hash here lets anyone who guesses the word confirm it, so no real word is listed here: the real words (former employers,
# people) go in a file outside the repository, named by NINSHUBUR_PRIVATE_WORDS_FILE.
